# ---- Self-timer ----
# Short capture delay so the shutter press itself doesn't shake the camera —
# matters most for handheld slow-shutter and long-exposure work. The countdown
# is armed by the shutter press and fired from the main preview loop; a second
# press while armed cancels it. Selected from the Timer section of the
# shutter-speed popup; persisted across boots.
